      "content": "hey im prepping for a moot court competition and im kind of stuck. the topic is about executive privilege vs congressional oversight. basically, in the context of modern governance, is the expansion of executive privilege a necessary protection for the presidency or a dangerous erosion of checks and balances? pls just pick the stronger legal position for me to argue so i have a starting point.",
